{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mass.KZHolonomy.BraidRep","lean:module:QOU.Mass.BraidHeckeFactor","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Module","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp"],"declarations":24,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.heckeOfKZTwoStrand","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.heckeOfKZTwoStrand","kind":"def","line":245,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L245-L251","doc":"**The two-strand KZ representation factors through `H₁(q)`**, `q = e^{2πiκ}`:\n`σ₀ ↦ e^{2πiκc} • θ(σ₀)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.kzTwoStrand_isHeckeQuad","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.kzTwoStrand_isHeckeQuad","kind":"theorem","line":226,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L226-L243","doc":"**The two-strand KZ generator satisfies the Hecke quadratic.** With `θ = 2πiκ`,\n`q = e^{θ}` and `s = e^{θc}`, the rescaled generator `β = s • θ(σ₀)` satisfies\n`β² = (q − q⁻¹)β + q q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.kzBraidRep_two_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.kzBraidRep_two_σ","kind":"theorem","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L215-L224","doc":"**The image of the Artin generator in closed form.** With `P = ρ(s₀)`, `θ = 2πiκ`:\n`θ(σ₀) = e^{θ(1−c)} e₊ − e^{−θ(1+c)} e₋`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.genFund_two_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.genFund_two_one","kind":"theorem","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L203-L213","doc":"**The two-strand KZ transport in closed form** (at time `1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.rho_adjSwap_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.rho_adjSwap_sq","kind":"theorem","line":200,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L200-L201","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.kzForm_genPath_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.kzForm_genPath_two","kind":"theorem","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L180-L195","doc":"**The two-strand KZ coefficient is constant** along the half-turn:\n`ω(γ₀(t))(γ₀'(t)) = θ (ρ(s₀) − c)` with `θ = 2πiκ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.dlog_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.dlog_two","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L167-L176","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eArc_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eArc_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L156-L165","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eArc'_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eArc'_eq","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L153-L154","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.usol_isFundSol","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.usol_isFundSol","kind":"theorem","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L135-L145","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.hasDerivAt_cexp_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.hasDerivAt_cexp_mul","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L126-L131","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.Usol","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.Usol","kind":"def","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L122-L124","doc":"`U(t) = e^{tθ(1−c)} e₊ + e^{−tθ(1+c)} e₋`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.resid_mul_eM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.resid_mul_eM","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L107-L112","doc":"The KZ residue `θ (P − c)` acts on `e₋` by `−θ(1 + c)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.resid_mul_eP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.resid_mul_eP","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L100-L105","doc":"The KZ residue `θ (P − c)` acts on `e₊` by `θ(1 − c)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.split_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.split_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L89-L98","doc":"**The Hecke quadratic on the split involution.** `β = q e₊ − q⁻¹ e₋` satisfies\n`β² = (q − q⁻¹)β + q q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eM_mul_eP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eM_mul_eP","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L84-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eP_mul_eM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eP_mul_eM","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L79-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eM_mul_eM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eM_mul_eM","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L74-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eP_mul_eP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eP_mul_eP","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L69-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eP_add_eM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eP_add_eM","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L65-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.P_mul_eM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.P_mul_eM","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L61-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.P_mul_eP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.P_mul_eP","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L57-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eM","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L52-L53","doc":"`e₋ = (1 − P)/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZTwoStrandHecke.eP","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZTwoStrandHecke.lean#L49-L50","doc":"`e₊ = (1 + P)/2`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}